{
  "declaredLength": 1616,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎光临贰流餐馆！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE51494E348D306D4199109986FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您要挑战全餐吗？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8898163116218516899105417FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次由哥哥我请客，\n你就好好享用美食吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B21753154E554E562118BF75BA2FF0C000A4F605C31597D597D4EAB75287F8E98DF542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想享用的，\n是名为美食的宝可梦对战。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F34EAB75287684FF0C000A662F540D4E3A7F8E98DF76845B9D53EF68A65BF9621830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我懂你的心情，\n但要考虑一下味道之类的问题哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D7136621161C24F6076845FC360C5FF0C000A4F468981800386514E004E0B547390534E4B7C7B768495EE989854E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想和宝可梦一起吃饭。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3548C5B9D53EF68A64E008D775403996D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今天的奶酪有……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“～经过180年熟成的\n究极硬质奶酪、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n散发的异臭能让人一闻\n就臭到鼻子变形的蓝纹奶酪、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用雌性阿柏怪的\n剧毒制成的洗皮奶酪～”。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜点跟平时一样……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要“～刺角果＆莓莓果雪葩\n佐满满香草慕斯～”。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C70B98DDF5E7365F64E0068372026202600100001BE01000A8981201CFF5E523A89D2679CFF0683938393679C96EA8469000A4F506EE16EE199998349615565AFFF5E201D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "味道不用多说……\n份量看起来也很让人满足啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547390534E0D7528591A8BF420262026000A4EFD91CF770B8D7767654E5F5F888BA94EBA6EE18DB3554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃不完的时候\n就打包给宝可梦吃吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54034E0D5B8C768465F65019000A5C31625353057ED95B9D53EF68A65403542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爸爸你……\n其实是个有钱人？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "723872384F6020262026000A51765B9E662F4E2A670994B14EBAFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果点什么都可以的话……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那么我就点这个好了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“～蔚蓝湾产\n酒烩呆呆兽尾巴卷<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n忘记配上忧心地凝视着<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n乱涂了特级初榨橙橙油的灵异少女的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n鬼斯的冰镇福禄果～”。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太大方了……\n是在ZA登峰战上赚了很多钱吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A592765B94E8620262026000A662F5728005A0041767B5CF062184E0A8D5A4E865F88591A94B15417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用客气，尽管点吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D75285BA26C14FF0C5C3D7BA170B9542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "观赏精彩的宝可梦对战，\n会让菜肴更加美味。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89C28D4F7CBE5F6976845B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A4F1A8BA983DC80B466F452A07F8E547330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦全力以赴的样子\n是顶级的调味料。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A65168529B4EE58D74768468375B50000A662F98767EA776848C035473659930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然！今天不是奶奶和孙子，\n而是两个大人的聚餐哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F537136FF014ECA59294E0D662F59765976548C5B595B50FF0C000A800C662F4E244E2A59274EBA7684805A991054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不用这么在意我的感受，\n我很享受一个人的时光哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D75288FD94E485728610F62117684611F53D7FF0C000A62115F884EAB53D74E004E2A4EBA768465F6514954E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要隐藏掉自己的气息，\n应该就不会被搭话了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981969085CF638981EA5DF176846C14606FFF0C000A5E948BE55C314E0D4F1A88AB642D8BDD4E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真是打从心底地\n享受用餐的时间啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F662F62534ECE5FC35E955730000A4EAB53D775289910768465F695F4554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果慢慢吃的话，\n饱腹中枢应该也会感到满足吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C61626162540376848BDDFF0C000A997181794E2D67A25E948BE54E5F4F1A611F52306EE18DB3542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的绵绵泡芙更加可爱！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176847EF57EF56CE1829966F452A053EF7231FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的芳香精才更迷人！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768482B399997CBE624D66F48FF74EBAFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是贰流餐馆！\n肉菜真是太美味了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F8D306D4199109986FF01000A808983DC771F662F592A7F8E54734E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "厨师阿尔伯的\n手艺更上一层楼了呀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53A85E08963F5C144F2F7684000A624B827A66F44E0A4E005C42697C4E86544030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然有点太奢侈了，\n但我努力了，所以没问题吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D7136670970B9592A59624F884E86FF0C000A4F46621152AA529B4E86FF0C62404EE56CA195EE9898542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要让客人会想再次光临，\n这是服务生应有的态度。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818BA95BA24EBA4F1A60F3518D6B2151494E34FF0C000A8FD9662F670D52A1751F5E946709768460015EA630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    }
  ],
